{"seq":1,"slug":"speech-signal-processing","title":"语音信号处理基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/foundations/speech-signal-processing","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"语音信号处理基础\">语音信号处理基础</h1><p>人耳听到的语音是一段连续的气压波动，而计算机只能处理离散的数字序列。语音合成的第一步，是深刻理解声音从物理振动变成可计算表示的全过程——这套知识决定了你在后续阅读 TTS 论文时能否读懂输入输出的含义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>采样与量化</strong>：数字音频的两个基础操作。采样率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定可表示的最高频率（奈奎斯特定理），量化位深决定动态范围</li>\n<li><strong>STFT（短时傅里叶变换）</strong>：把一维波形转换成时频二维表示。分帧、加窗、FFT 后得到幅度谱与相位谱，是经典 TTS 特征提取的基础</li>\n<li><strong>Mel 频谱</strong>：用三角滤波器组把线性频率轴映射到人耳感知尺度，把数百个频率 bin 压缩为 80-128 维紧凑特征</li>\n<li><strong>基频 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>：声带振动的频率，决定语调与情感表达，是韵律建模的核心物理量</li>\n<li><strong>声码器（Vocoder）</strong>：把频谱特征还原为时域波形的最后一环，经历了信号处理 → 自回归神经 → GAN → Neural Codec 的代际演进</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"从模拟到数字-采样与量化\">从模拟到数字：采样与量化</h2><p>声波在空气中传播时是连续的模拟信号。将它转化为数字信号需要两步操作：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>采样（Sampling）</strong>：按固定时间间隔记录信号幅度。采样率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示每秒采集的样本数，常见取值包括 16 kHz（语音识别）、24 kHz（现代 TTS）、44.1 kHz（CD 音质）和 48 kHz（专业音频）。</li>\n<li><strong>量化（Quantization）</strong>：将连续幅度映射到有限精度的整数。16-bit 量化提供 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>65536</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{16} = 65536</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65536</span></span></span></span></span> 个离散电平，动态范围约 96 dB。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>奈奎斯特定理规定：采样率必须至少是信号最高频率的两倍，否则产生混叠。人类语音的有效频率范围约 80 Hz - 8 kHz，因此 16 kHz 采样率足以覆盖大多数语音信息。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样率</td>\n<td>16 kHz / 24 kHz / 48 kHz</td>\n<td>每秒采样点数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位深度</td>\n<td>16-bit / 24-bit</td>\n<td>每个采样点的量化精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帧长</td>\n<td>20-25 ms</td>\n<td>短时分析窗口长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帧移</td>\n<td>10 ms</td>\n<td>相邻帧的偏移量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预加重系数</td>\n<td>0.97</td>\n<td>高频补偿滤波器系数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时频分析-从波形到频谱\">时频分析：从波形到频谱</h2><p>语音信号的关键信息隐藏在频率结构中，而非原始波形。短时傅里叶变换（STFT）是从时域进入频域的标准工具：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X(m, k) = \\sum_{n=0}^{N-1} x(n + mH) \\cdot w(n) \\cdot e^{-j2\\pi kn/N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是帧索引，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是频率 bin 索引，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 是帧移（hop size），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是窗函数（通常为 Hann 窗）。STFT 的输出是一个二维复数矩阵，取模得到<strong>幅度谱</strong>（spectrogram），取相位得到<strong>相位谱</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[原始波形 PCM] --&gt; B[分帧 + 加窗]&#10;    B --&gt; C[FFT]&#10;    C --&gt; D[幅度谱]&#10;    C --&gt; E[相位谱]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Mel 滤波器组]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Mel 频谱图]&#10;    G --&gt; H[对数压缩]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Log-Mel 特征]\">flowchart LR\n    A[原始波形 PCM] --&gt; B[分帧 + 加窗]\n    B --&gt; C[FFT]\n    C --&gt; D[幅度谱]\n    C --&gt; E[相位谱]\n    D --&gt; F[Mel 滤波器组]\n    F --&gt; G[Mel 频谱图]\n    G --&gt; H[对数压缩]\n    H --&gt; I[Log-Mel 特征]</pre><h2 id=\"mel-频谱与感知尺度\">Mel 频谱与感知尺度</h2><p>人耳对频率的感知是非线性的：低频段的分辨能力远强于高频段。Mel 尺度通过一组三角滤波器将线性频率轴映射到感知尺度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mel</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2595</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>f</mi><mn>700</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mel}(f) = 2595 \\cdot \\log_{10}\\left(1 + \\frac{f}{700}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mel</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2595</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">700</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型的 Mel 频谱图使用 80-128 个 Mel 滤波器，将 STFT 的数百个频率 bin 压缩为紧凑的特征向量。在 2020 年之前，几乎所有 TTS 系统（Tacotron 2、FastSpeech 2）都以 Mel 频谱图作为中间表示，再通过声码器（vocoder）转换为波形。</p>\n<p>2023 年后的 Neural Codec 模型（EnCodec、SoundStream、DAC）直接在波形域工作，将 Mel 频谱这一中间步骤完全跳过——但理解 Mel 特征仍然是读懂传统 TTS 文献和评估指标的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基频与韵律特征\">基频与韵律特征</h2><p><strong>基频</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，Fundamental Frequency）是语音韵律的核心物理量，对应声带振动的周期。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的变化决定了说话人的语调（升调、降调、平调）和情感表达。</p>\n<p>提取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的经典算法包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自相关法（Autocorrelation）</strong>：计算信号与自身延迟版本的相似度，峰值位置对应周期。</li>\n<li><strong>CREPE</strong>（2018）：基于 CNN 的端到端基频估计器，鲁棒性显著优于传统方法。</li>\n<li><strong>FCPE</strong>（2024）：更轻量的实时基频追踪，适合 TTS 推理管线中的在线提取。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>韵律特征还包括<strong>时长</strong>（每个音素持续多久）、<strong>能量</strong>（响度变化）和<strong>停顿</strong>模式。现代 TTS 模型通常不再显式建模这些特征，而是让神经网络从数据中隐式学习——但在可控合成（Controllable TTS）场景中，显式韵律表示仍然不可或缺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"声码器-从特征到波形\">声码器：从特征到波形</h2><p>声码器（Vocoder）是 TTS 管线的最后一环，将频谱特征还原为时域波形。其演进历程反映了整个语音合成领域的技术跃迁：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n<th>核心方法</th>\n<th>实时率 (RTF)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号处理</td>\n<td>Griffin-Lim</td>\n<td>迭代相位恢复</td>\n<td>&lt;0.01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自回归神经</td>\n<td>WaveNet (2016)</td>\n<td>逐样本自回归</td>\n<td>~1000x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流式生成</td>\n<td>WaveRNN (2018)</td>\n<td>单层 GRU + 剪枝</td>\n<td>~4x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GAN 声码器</td>\n<td>HiFi-GAN (2020)</td>\n<td>多尺度判别器</td>\n<td>&lt;0.01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩散声码器</td>\n<td>WaveGrad (2021)</td>\n<td>分数匹配</td>\n<td>~6x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编解码器</td>\n<td>EnCodec (2022)</td>\n<td>RVQ + 端到端</td>\n<td>&lt;0.05</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>HiFi-GAN 是当前最广泛部署的声码器，其多周期判别器（MPD）和多尺度判别器（MSD）的组合保证了波形的保真度。2023 年后，Neural Codec 模型（详见本章第 3 篇）进一步将声码器与特征提取融为一体，实现了真正的端到端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>采样率和量化位深决定了数字音频的信息容量上限</li>\n<li>STFT 和 Mel 频谱图是经典 TTS 的核心表示管线</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和韵律特征控制语音的自然度和表达力</li>\n<li>声码器经历了从信号处理到 GAN 再到 Neural Codec 的三代演进</li>\n<li>现代 TTS 已跳过 Mel 频谱，直接在离散 token 域生成语音</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"acoustic-models-evolution\">声学模型演进：从拼接式到端到端</a> —— 了解 TTS 系统架构的整体演变</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../nlp-transformers/foundations/transformer-architecture\">Transformer 架构</a> —— 当前 TTS 模型的骨干网络基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语音信号处理基础","id":"语音信号处理基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从模拟到数字：采样与量化","id":"从模拟到数字-采样与量化"},{"level":2,"text":"时频分析：从波形到频谱","id":"时频分析-从波形到频谱"},{"level":2,"text":"Mel 频谱与感知尺度","id":"mel-频谱与感知尺度"},{"level":2,"text":"基频与韵律特征","id":"基频与韵律特征"},{"level":2,"text":"声码器：从特征到波形","id":"声码器-从特征到波形"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"声学模型演进：从拼接式到端到端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/foundations/acoustic-models-evolution"}}